          "code": "PREPARE_JOB_SEARCH_QUERY_BY_UNDERSTANDING_THE_RESUME",
          "id": "1769693351545",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769693351548_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI assistant responsible for analyzing candidate referral emails and resume attachments.\nExtract information only from the attachment provided below.\nDo not infer, enrich, or use any other data source.\n\nYou will be provided with:\n  One resume attachment containing candidate details (resume text)\n\nYour task is to analyze ONLY the provided input data and generate a structured job-search payload.\n\nInstructions (VERY IMPORTANT):\n1. Use ONLY the information present in the input.\n2. Do NOT invent or infer missing details.\n3. Do NOT include explanations, comments, or extra fields.\n4. Do NOT modify file names or resume text content.\n5. Output must be a SINGLE JSON object only.\n\nField Mapping Rules:\n\n  JobSearchQuery:\n  Generate a comma-separated list of keywords derived strictly from the resume content, including:\n      Primary skills\n      Key technologies\n      Relevant roles/titles\n      Location details present in the resume (city/state/country)\n\nThe JobSearchQuery must be suitable for searching open job requisitions.\n\nInput:\n {{$context.$variables.candidateResumeAsString}} \n\nOutput JSON Format (STRICT):\n{\n  \"JobSearchQuery\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n Values must come strictly from the attachment or email content\n  If a value is not present, return an empty string\n  FileName must include the extension\n  No explanations, no comments, no additional keys\n  JSON only"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set job Search Query Parameter"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1769152320477"
          },
